2026-08-10 16:02:12,434 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  All Metadata     : {'source': 'uploads\\AIML landscape.pdf', 'page': 0, 'file_type': 'pdf', 'extractor': 'docling', 'original_content': '- Application areas are primarily scheduling agents, virtual assistants, search engines, translators\n- Select companies interviewed by Magister:\n- Twiggle (IL): Al based search engine for e-commerce customers\n\n::\n\n- Snips (FR): Voice and text based Al assistant\n- Gluru (UK): Smart assistant to organize events, meetings\n- Other representative companies in EU/Israel\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## IMAGE PROCESSING\n\n- lm          of the highest value exits — Magic Pony acquired by Twitter for $150m\n- Select companies interviewed by Magister:\n- Real Eyes (UK): Emotion analysis for brands and media agencies\n- MedyMatch (IL): Computer vision for emergency room decision making\n- Other representative companies in EU/Israel\n\n<!-- image -->\n\ndeepomatic Intendu n@an\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## PREDICTION AND ANALYTICS\n\n- Prediction and Analytics is the largest category with applications in variety of industries including Retail, Finance, AdTech, Healthcare, Cybersecurity\n- Select companies interviewed by Magister:\n- Featurespace (UK): Fraud detection for financial services, insurance and gaming industries\n- Tinyclues (FR): Audience targeting platform for brands and retail clients\n- Other representative companies in EU/Israel\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nonfido tinyclues\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nSkinVision\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## BROAD RANGE OF INDUSTRIES\n\n## HEALTHCARE\n\n- Traditionally, Healthcare companies have been slow in leveraging computing technologies leaving an opportunity for Al startups\n- Prime areas of innovation include image diagnosis, virtual doctors, lifestyle management, emergency room management and medical research\n- Israel is leading the way in diagnosis using computer vision (Medymatch, Zebra Computer Vision) while UK in virtual doctors (Your.MD, Babylon) and lifestyle management (Biobeats)\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## FINANCE', '_id': '63d9b2c3-7ac2-4bc5-b5e4-4de9123ef1e7', '_collection_name': 'docmind_green'}
