2026-08-10 16:15:32,958 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  All Metadata     : {'source': 'https://www.volkswagen.co.in/en/models/virtus-sport.html', 'source_type': 'url', 'domain': 'www.volkswagen.co.in', 'title': 'Volkswagen Virtus Anniversary Edition | Avocado Pearl', 'description': 'Celebrate 4 years of the Volkswagen Virtus with the Anniversary Edition in the exclusive Avocado Pearl colour. It celebrates everything drivers have come to love about the Virtus GT Plus Sport and more.', 'scraped_at': '2026-08-10 14:33:23', 'section': 'Virtus Anniversary Edition', 'original_content': 'Virtus Anniversary Edition\n\n• GT Line price starting ₹ 14.34 Lakh*\n• GT Plus Sport price starting ₹ 19.19 Lakh*\nVirtus Anniversary Edition Four years of being India’s No.1 Premium Sedan is more than a milestone. It celebrates the journey of the Virtus and the passion of those who continue to choose it. The Virtus GT Plus Sport stays true to what makes it special, with its 1.5L TSI EVO engine, 150 PS of power, 250 Nm of torque and a responsive 7-speed DSG transmission.\u200b\n\u200bThe Virtus Anniversary Edition gives the drive a distinctive new look. Finished in exclusive Avocado Pearl with a contrasting black roof and black alloy wheels, it enhances the sedan’s sporty and premium character.\xa0With Volkswagen Genuine accessories such as a 360° Camera System, Front Parking Sensors and Puddle Lamps, and limited to just 150 units, it brings even more desirability to every drive.', '_id': '1748f80e-8419-4ac4-826f-19c5fd948abd', '_collection_name': 'docmind_green'}
