2026-08-10 16:18:47,210 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  Dr. Carlos Guestrin and his co-teacher Dr. Emily Fox, who are Amazon Professors of Machine Learning at the University of Washington, teach the Machine Learning Specialization on Coursera. Incidentally, Carlos got his PhD from Stanford under Coursera founder Daphne Koller.
