2026-08-10 16:18:47,457 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  ## EU /ISRAEL AI LANDSCAPE KEYFINDINGS
2026-08-10 16:18:47,458 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-10 16:18:47,458 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  - Magister interviewed 40+ Artificial Intelligence companies across the EU / Israel in a range of application areas, 1 from healthcare to analytics to music production
2026-08-10 16:18:47,460 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  - We see the current 'boom' in Al funding creating significant value due to increased computational capabilities, 2 big data and efficient algorithms
2026-08-10 16:18:47,461 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  - Potential Al 'winners' are all over Europe not just in UK and Israel. Key industries of focus are: Healthcare, 3 Finance, Retail, AdTech/MarTech and Cybersecurity
2026-08-10 16:18:47,461 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  - 4 We expect to see 15-20 EU / Israel Al acquisitions in 2017 at valuations as high as $10m per employee
2026-08-10 16:18:47,462 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  - 5 We expect an increased interest from mid cap tech and non tech companies following acquisitions by Ford, PTC, 24/7,Quixey
2026-08-10 16:18:47,463 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  - In terms of financings, we expect to see a growing number of smaller financing rounds, as Al companies expand 6 incrementally. We do not see huge financing rounds for Al companies as most will be acquired.
2026-08-10 16:18:47,463 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-10 16:18:47,463 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  <!-- image -->
