2026-08-10 16:18:47,464 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  ## AI HAS EXPERIENCED SEVERAL FALSE DAWNS
2026-08-10 16:18:47,465 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-10 16:18:47,465 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  <!-- image -->
