2026-08-10 16:18:47,467 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  Due to lack of progress on machine translation, US govt. ended the support after having spent $20m. It was concluded that "machine translation was more expensive, less accurate and slower than human translation'
2026-08-10 16:18:47,470 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-10 16:18:47,471 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  —Automatic Language Processing Advisory Committee
2026-08-10 16:18:47,473 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-10 16:18:47,474 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  "In no part of the field have discoveries made so far produced the major impact that was then promised. Al techniques may work within the scope of small problem domains, but techniques would not scale up to solve more realistic problems"
2026-08-10 16:18:47,475 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-10 16:18:47,476 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  —Lighthill report, published by British Science Research Council, that led to funding cuts for most British universities
