2026-08-11 14:29:31,411 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  All Metadata     : {'source': 'uploads\\AIML landscape.pdf', 'page': 0, 'file_type': 'pdf', 'extractor': 'docling', 'original_content': "We've seen 10 EU Al acquisitions in 2016 up from 2 in 2013; we expect the number to increase in the coming years\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## WHAT IS DRIVING M&amp;A ACTIVITY BYFUNCTIONALITY\n\n## CORE AI\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nMedian Deal Value: $304m | Medial EV/FTE: $8.3m\n\n- The targets in this category are very high value compared to others and are largely driven by team capabilities\n- For e.g. Google acquired Deepmind for expertise of Demis Hassabis, former neuroscience research fellow at UCL and Apple's acquired Turi for Carlos Guestrin, Prof. at University of Washington\n\n## NATURAL LANGUAGE PROCESSING\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nMedian Deal Value: $73m | Medial EV/FTE: $1.3m\n\n- Buyers in this category are looking to improve voice and natural language capabilities to include contextual awareness, better semantic understanding\n- Industry wise, buyers come from social media (Facebook), mobile OS developers (Apple, Google), market research firms (Gartner)\n\n## IMAGE PROCESSING\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nMedian Deal Value: $62m | Medial EV/FTE: $1.7m\n\n- Image processing has seen the highest growth among all the categories with buyers coming from all industries - Social media, semiconductor, retail etc.\n- Key deals include Intel's acquisition of Movidius, ARM's acquisition of Apical, Twitter's acquisition of Magic Pony\n\n## PREDICTION AND ANALYTICS\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nMedian Deal Value: $82m | Medial EV/FTE: $2.1m\n\n- Acquisitions in this category peaked in 2015, we've seen a decline in 2016 as Al powered analytics become commoditized\n- Buyers are looking to improve search, recommendation, targeting capabilities\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## LARGE COMPANIES SCRAMBLE FOR SCARCE TALENT DRIVING UP DEAL VALUES\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Sep-2016\n\n## Amazon adds chatbot expertise by hiring Angel.ai co-founder", '_id': '39fc2ece-da91-4c92-ad7f-164ad3f22ad3', '_collection_name': 'docmind_blue'}
