2026-08-11 15:02:08,987 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  ## Discover a new kind of space
2026-08-11 15:02:08,988 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-11 15:02:08,989 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  Introducing your new drive, where elegance embraces grandeur.
2026-08-11 15:02:08,990 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-11 15:02:08,991 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  With more room in all three rows, every passenger gets the comfort they deserve. The new Ergo seats don't just support, they let you unwind, one soothing massage at a time. Smart controls put everything at your fingertips, while an intuitive infotainment system turns every drive into an experience.
2026-08-11 15:02:08,993 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-11 15:02:08,994 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  The all-new Kodiaq is a sanctuary on the move. A space where elegance meets innovation.
2026-08-11 15:02:08,995 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-11 15:02:08,995 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  Kodiaq
2026-08-11 15:02:08,997 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-11 15:02:09,000 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  ## Your space to command
2026-08-11 15:02:09,001 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-11 15:02:09,002 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  Space isn't just about size, it's about presence. With bolder design and sleeker proportions, the new look is as refined as it is capable. A sanctuary for your family, an escape for your adventures. And where you want to reach, you should arrive in style and with confidence.
2026-08-11 15:02:09,004 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-11 15:02:09,006 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  Kodiaq
2026-08-11 15:02:09,007 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-11 15:02:09,009 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  ## Bigger. Bolder. Better.
2026-08-11 15:02:09,010 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-11 15:02:09,015 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  The longer length allows for a sleeker, more elegant profile, underscored by details like D-pillar in Unique Dark Chrome finish. Your family's stylish partner for exploring the world.
