2026-08-11 15:02:09,023 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  ## LED headlights
2026-08-11 15:02:09,024 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-11 15:02:09,026 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  The coloured crystalline element accentuates the sharp contours of the headlights, adding a touch of elegance and visual appeal.
2026-08-11 15:02:09,026 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-11 15:02:09,027 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  ## Front grille with horizontal light strip
2026-08-11 15:02:09,029 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-11 15:02:09,030 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  To grab even more attention on the road, the new wider and bolder grille has a horizontal Light Strip. This makes the all-new Kodiaq an unmistakable sight when driving at night.
2026-08-11 15:02:09,031 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  
2026-08-11 15:02:09,033 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  ## Let the sky follow you
