2026-08-11 15:02:09,336 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  See everything. Blind no one. Using a multi-function camera, the system detects oncoming traffic and automatically adjusts the beam, maintaining maximum visibility for you, while shielding others from glare. Precision lighting, for confident night driving.
