2026-08-11 15:04:33,358 | INFO     | utils.chatbot |   The Skoda Kodiaq is a vehicle that offers a spacious interior, with more room in all three rows of seats. This allows every passenger to have the comfort they deserve. The Ergo seats are designed to support and unwind passengers, featuring soothing massage functions.
2026-08-11 15:04:33,359 | INFO     | utils.chatbot |   
2026-08-11 15:04:33,359 | INFO     | utils.chatbot |   The Kodiaq also features smart controls and an intuitive infotainment system, which turns every drive into an experience. It has a bold design with sleeker lines, giving it a more modern look. Some of its notable features include ambient lighting on the dashboard and doors, which can be set to any color, and wireless charging for two phones.
2026-08-11 15:04:33,359 | INFO     | utils.chatbot |   
2026-08-11 15:04:33,360 | INFO     | utils.chatbot |   The Kodiaq is available in various trim levels, including Lounge, Sportline, and Selection L&K. Each trim level offers different equipment, such as infotainment systems with touchscreens of varying sizes, sound systems, and connectivity options like Apple CarPlay and Android Auto.
2026-08-11 15:04:33,360 | INFO     | utils.chatbot |   
2026-08-11 15:04:33,360 | INFO     | utils.chatbot |   In terms of safety features, the Kodiaq has a range of advanced technologies, including Park Distance Control parking sensors, 360-degree Area View Camera, and Intelligent Park Assist. It also offers various convenience features, such as electric tailgates with virtual pedals and remote folding pull handles in the boot for second-row passengers.
2026-08-11 15:04:33,360 | INFO     | utils.chatbot |   
2026-08-11 15:04:33,360 | INFO     | utils.chatbot |   Overall, the Skoda Kodiaq is designed to provide a comfortable, convenient, and safe driving experience, making it an attractive option for those looking for a spacious and feature-packed vehicle.
