2026-08-11 15:07:42,799 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  All Metadata     : {'source': 'uploads\\Kylaq.pdf', 'page': 0, 'file_type': 'pdf', 'extractor': 'docling', 'original_content': "MH14TCM310\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nSEOTS\n\n## Interior Design\n\nStep inside the Škoda Kylaq, and you're greeted by an environment that's as refined as it is welcoming. With an ambiance tailored for comfort, it's a space you'll love to call your own.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Comfort Safety\n\nBecause safety and comfort should never be options, we designed the Škoda Kylaq with ultimate protection and ease as our top priorities. A car that doesn't just get you there, its thoughtful design touches and advanced safety features ensure every drive is a seamless blend of peace of mind and care for your journeys.\n\nSafest car in its segment MH14TCM310\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nGet comfy with Adjustable Headrest Sit back and relax with Comfortable Rear Armrest PLALL\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nSpeed at your fingertips with\n\nPaddle Shifters\n\n## Simply Clever Features\n\nThoughtful solutions built seamlessly into its design, it's a car that makes every journey smarter, simpler, and undeniably more enjoyable.\n\nKylaq\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Wheels\n\nClassic+ Steel Wheel R(16) with full cover, CARPO\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nSignature/ Signature+ Silver Alloy Wheel R(16), SARGAS\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Upholstery\n\nPrestige/ Prestige+ Dual Tone\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nAlloy Wheel R(17), BENNY\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Price List and Colours\n\n| Kylaq Variants   | MT        | AT        |\n|------------------|-----------|-----------|\n| Classic          | 7 59 000  |           |\n| Classic+         | 8 25 000  | 9 25 000  |\n| Signature        | 9 43 000  | 10 43 000 |\n| Signature+       | 10 77 000 | 11 77 000 |\n| Prestige         | 11 75 000 | 12 75 000 |\n| Prestige+        | 11 99 000 | 12 99 000 |\n\nEx-Showroom price\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nCherry Red", '_id': 'c4f49e40-bec6-41e0-9778-b04fee8c1e34', '_collection_name': 'docmind_blue'}
