2026-08-11 15:07:43,257 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  All Metadata     : {'source': 'uploads\\AIML landscape.pdf', 'page': 0, 'file_type': 'pdf', 'extractor': 'docling', 'original_content': "Median deal value per employee for Al companies with sub 50 employees increased to $8.5m in 2016 (YTD) up from $1.1m in 2013\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## MEDIAN ROIC HIGHER FOR EU / ISRAEL AI COMPANIES COMPARED TO US\n\n35.0x EU / Israel Al companies reach critical mass (i.e. ready to be acquired) with lower funding compared to US, explaining higher ROICs\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## INVESTING ACTIVITY DOMINATED BY SMALLER DEALS\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nThere has been steady increase in global Al funding since 2010, a 10x increase from $0.3B in 2012 to $3.4B in 2016\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## LEADING EU VC INVESTORS PICKING UP AFTER A PERIOD OF ONLY NICHE INVESTORS\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nMar-2016\n\n## Atomico leads $8 mln Series A for Mapillary\n\nMALMO, SWEDEN-(Marketwired – Mar 3, 2016) – Mapillary, a community-based photomapping platform, today announced an $8 million Series A funding round led by Atomico, with participation from Sequoia, LDV Capital, and PlayFair.\n\nAnyone can contribute photos to the Mapillary platform and mobile app (available on iOS and Android) with a smartphone or action camera. The company's computer are meticulously stitched together on the map alongside other users' photos, vision software automatically extracts geographic information, blurs license plates and faces, and detects traffic signs from each photo uploaded. Then, the photos creating a digital representation of each location through the eyes of those who have been there. Mapillary's growing global community has uploaded over 50 million photos and mapped more than 1.2 million kilometers in over 170 countries to date.\n\n## Total Funding: $9.5m\n\nInvestors: Atomico, Playfair Capital, Sequoia Capital, Wellington Partners Apr-2016\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Idinvest et al. in $25m series-B for Onfido", '_id': '38ec6922-1ceb-424d-9bb5-968067c138bc', '_collection_name': 'docmind_blue'}
