l steering wheel offers hassle-free audio control with stylish chrome scrollers and adjustable positioning for driver comfort.\n\nClimatronic Air Conditioning with Aircare Function Climatronic automatic air conditioning maximizes\n\n<!-- image -->', '_id': '0ba84ef2-2453-43e6-ac05-9b4b76551511', '_collection_name': 'docmind_blue'}
