2026-08-12 11:40:01,344 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  All Metadata     : {'source': 'https://www.volkswagen.co.in/en/models/virtus-chrome.html', 'source_type': 'url', 'domain': 'www.volkswagen.co.in', 'title': 'VW Virtus Chrome | 5-Star GNCAP-Rated Sedan at ₹10.70 Lakh*', 'description': 'Cruise in style in the Virtus Chrome with 5-star GNCAP rating, 40+ safety features and an unmatched driving experience.', 'scraped_at': '2026-08-10 16:16:20', 'section': '5-star Safety', 'original_content': "5-star Safety\n\nVolkswagen Virtus achieved a 5-star rating in Global NCAP's updated crash tests, becoming one of the first safest sedan models ever in India to achieve five stars for both adult and child occupants' protection. Equipped with 40 safety features and the best of German-engineering, this badge is a testament to Volkswagen ’s continued commitment to engineering for unmatched safety. At Volkswagen , safety has been at the core of our German DNA and this badge is a reaffirmation of the faith our customers, like you, have always had.\nVolkswagen cars were tested for 24 relentless hours at Asia’s largest test track, Natrax. The Virtus 1.5L TSI EVO and Virtus 1.0L TSI raced non-stop for the duration, to prove the unmatched performance and efficiency of our TSI engine. We made it to the India Book of Records, setting new benchmarks.\nIndia Record for the maximum distance covered in 24 hours (overall): VW Virtus GT 1.5L,\xa04654.48 km*\nIndia Record for the maximum distance covered in 24 hours (sedan): VW Virtus GT 1.5L,\xa04654.48 km*\nIndia Record for the maximum distance covered in 24 hours (sedan) (1.0L): VW Virtus 1.0L TSI, 4357.21 km*\n*Overall results", '_id': '52954bc5-0354-44ef-9642-304e656d6b92', '_collection_name': 'docmind_blue'}
