2026-08-12 11:44:21,401 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  All Metadata     : {'source': 'uploads\\AIML landscape.pdf', 'page': 0, 'file_type': 'pdf', 'extractor': 'docling', 'original_content': '<!-- image -->\n\n- Deep Unsupervised Al algorithms: allow Tinyclues to metabolise customer data including user attributes, transaction history, campaign history to categorise the customers. The algorithms are self learning and not industry standard static "rules".\n- Lookalike models: Identifies the most optimal target segment for a product that closely resemble customers who bought the particular product. The models are free from biases in culture and industry.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n\'Over the next few years, Al will redefine how B2C marketers interact with their customers. Data driven insights will replace preconceptions. Selfoptimizing flows will replace simplistic rules. In that context we enable marketers to reap the benefits of advanced Al &amp; automation while retaining strategic control of their CRM. Tinyclues is the leading contender in the space because we are able to provide value to businesses in an undisputable way!\' - David Bessis, Founder &amp; CEO at Tinyclues\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## tinyclues\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## TWIGGLE \'E-COMMERCE SEARCH DONE BETTER\'\n\n## Company Overview\n\n- Description: Provider of Al powered online search solutions to tier 1 e-commerce companies with $1b+ in revenues\n- Business model: Revenue is earned through subscription fees which is based on usage, search volume and size of product catalog\n- Total Funding: $20m+\n- Key Investors: Alibaba, Naspers, Yahoo Japan, State Of Mind Ventures, Jeremy Yap\n\n- Founded: 2014\n\n- Headquarters: Tel Aviv, Israel\n\n- Employees: 39\n\n## Key Management\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n- Amir Konigsberg PhD - Co-Founder &amp; CEO FoundingMember of Google Operations in Israel\n- Adi Avidor - Co-founder &amp; CTO Former Software Engineer at Google\n- Amir Di-Nur - VP of Research and Development Founded Google\'s NetworkingInfrastructure Group in Israel\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Products &amp; Technology\n\n<!-- image -->', '_id': '712bebf8-685b-4ea5-909c-7af7270fe6b1', '_collection_name': 'docmind_blue'}
