2026-08-12 11:44:21,455 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  - Indexing: The normalised product information allows Twiggle to better index the product catalogue and provide much more relevant and less "embarrassing" search results
2026-08-12 11:44:21,456 | INFO     | utils.chatbot | │  - Marketplaces: Twiggle's search algorithms also leverage image processing and are effective in marketplaces where product information consists of images with little to no textual data
